    "Asset Class Three of our foundational wealth architecture is Real Estate and Real Estate Investment Trusts (REITs). Historically, real estate has produced more millionaires than almost any other physical asset class. Owning physical land and residential or commercial buildings provides an unbeatable combination of tangible utility, rental income cash flow, tax incentives, and long-term equity appreciation.",
